# RaktSetu needs no environment variables — there is nothing here to copy.
#
# The application is self-contained: accounts, requests, alerts, notifications,
# donation history, campus drives and moderation state all live in the
# visitor's own browser (see src/lib/local). There is no database URL, no API key
# and no service-role secret, locally or on Netlify.
#
# A .env.local left over from an earlier cloud-based build is harmless: no source
# file reads process.env at all, which `npm run check:invariants` enforces.
